DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261117
SUMMARY:6 × 300 m intervals
DESCRIPTION:Warm up 10–15 min easy plus drills and strides. 6 × 300 m 
 at 68–70 sec (3:47–3:53/km)\; 90 sec walk/easy jog recovery\; RPE 7–8
 . Cool down 5–10 min. Run only if back and lower legs feel normal.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
