SUMMARY:2 km time trial
DESCRIPTION:Warm up 10–15 min easy plus drills and progressive strides
 . Sub-7:50 benchmark\; 7:40 strong\; 7:30 stretch. For 7:40 aim 1:32 
 per 400 m. Record splits and RPE.
